# ADCX—Unsigned Integer Addition of Two Operands With Carry Flag -- override
# 'DEST := DEST + SRC + CF;' with only CF written (the manual's Operation
# says it through prose: "IF OperandSize is 64-bit ..."); the ADC idiom.
@operation
DEST := DEST + SRC + CF;
@flags
The CF flag is set according to the result. The OF, SF, ZF, AF and PF flags are not affected.
